<title>USA: TABLE-National-Standard Q3 June 30 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-National-Standard Q3 June 30 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Mich. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000 except per share amounts)</p>
<p>For three-months ended June 30:</p>
<p>				    1997		   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		     64,701		 60,853</p>
<p> Net Income			 264		  1,369</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     .05		    .26</p>
<p> Average Shares	   5,255,211	    5,338,164</p>
<p>For nine months ended</p>
<p>June 30:</p>
<p> Net Sales		    187,702		187,400</p>
<p> Net Income		   (9,686)		  7,223</p>
<p> Earnings per Share	 (1.83)*		 1.35**</p>
<p> Average Shares	   5,279,640	    5,365,895</p>
<p>    *    The nine-month period ended June 1997 per share data</p>
<p>of $(1.83) includes $(1.86) per share related to the restructuring charge.</p>
<p>    **    The nine-month period ended June 1996 per share data</p>
<p>of $1.35 includes $0.66 per share related to the sale of shares of the Allmerica.</p>
<p>Full name of company is National-Standard Co.</p>
</text>
